  "description": "Kernel of PowerCraft.Secrets: an encrypted secret store on disk. A secret is a folder and each of its properties is one OpenPGP file, so names are read without a key and no value is kept in plain text. The key is protected by a passphrase that the credential store of the operating system keeps, or that an unattended host supplies. Cross-platform, and needs no gpg installation.",
